{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1274855-second-sight-third-eye","id":1274855,"title":"Second Sight Third Eye","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-17T03:29:12-08:00","id":1274855,"title":"Second Sight Third Eye","content":"Is it a thorough update and is it worth buying?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23573-thricehonored","name":"ThriceHonored","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-17T22:12:13-08:00","id":1275020,"title":"","content":"I think it was worth it. Few more powers would've been nice, like new versions of Enchantment and Internal Alchemy, but I can homebrew them easily enough. Cleaner, updated systems for powers, templates and dark cults are nice. ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1274-crazy_ivan","name":"Crazy_Ivan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1274_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T03:20:06-08:00","id":1275054,"title":"","content":"Woah, when did this come out?<br /> <br /> [Edit] Hah, it touches on the Clash of Wills topic that I was asking about right from the get go. They went with the less exciting, but more consistent option.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":2757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","user":"proindrakenzol","date":". 12-18-2018, 06:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T09:54:10-08:00","id":1275101,"title":"","content":"I think it's worth buying but I may be partially biased...<br /> <br /> But if you have any questions about it, feel free to ask.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crazy_Ivan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1274855-second-sight-third-eye?p=1275020#post1275020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it was worth it. Few more powers would've been nice, like new versions of Enchantment and Internal Alchemy, but I can homebrew them easily enough. Cleaner, updated systems for powers, templates and dark cults are nice. ^^</div> </div> </div> </div>The idea was that I didn't want to replicate things too much. Internal Alchemy is partially covered by Biokinesis at the low level, and then the higher level I made its own merit , Ephemeral Transmutation (more expensive since it's no longer template-exclusive, admittedly). Admittedly it'd likely be good to have a mental equivalent of Biokinesis to round that out. Something to add to my list for if I do a major update of the book down the line.<br /> <br /> Similarly, Enchantment is covered by Psychic Empathy (which I even mentioned is sometimes called &quot;Enchantment&quot;) which a THaumaturge can then use their merit to ritualize.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T10:09:36-08:00","id":1275104,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>falco1029</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1274855-second-sight-third-eye?p=1275101#post1275101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it's worth buying but I may be partially biased...<br /> <br /> But if you have any questions about it, feel free to ask.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The idea was that I didn't want to replicate things too much. Internal Alchemy is partially covered by Biokinesis at the low level, and then the higher level I made its own merit , Ephemeral Transmutation (more expensive since it's no longer template-exclusive, admittedly). Admittedly it'd likely be good to have a mental equivalent of Biokinesis to round that out. Something to add to my list for if I do a major update of the book down the line.<br /> <br /> Similarly, Enchantment is covered by Psychic Empathy (which I even mentioned is sometimes called &amp;quot;Enchantment&amp;quot<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> which a THaumaturge can then use their merit to ritualize.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, true that. But yeah, I like this book a lot. The thaumaturge template is much more versatile, powerful and streamlined than before and the ability to ritualize Instant powers is great. Running a game focused on Second Sight and Reliquary now, and this will be useful. \ud83d\ude01<br /> <br /> Edit: And I will propably use new Activation Option for thaumaturges, Ritual. Meaning Merit that would normally be instant can\u00b4t be activated without a ritual that takes less time than normal meditation roll, similar to old Second Sight low magic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1274,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1274-crazy_ivan","user":"Crazy_Ivan","date":". 12-18-2018, 04:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1274-crazy_ivan","name":"Crazy_Ivan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1274_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T15:44:33-08:00","id":1275186,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crazy_Ivan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1274855-second-sight-third-eye?p=1275104#post1275104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, true that. But yeah, I like this book a lot. The thaumaturge template is much more versatile, powerful and streamlined than before and the ability to ritualize Instant powers is great. Running a game focused on Second Sight and Reliquary now, and this will be useful. \ud83d\ude01<br /> <br /> Edit: And I will propably use new Activation Option for thaumaturges, Ritual. Meaning Merit that would normally be instant can\u00b4t be activated without a ritual that takes less time than normal meditation roll, similar to old Second Sight low magic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Glad to hear it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-19T02:13:41-08:00","id":1275254,"title":"","content":"What about shamans and vodouns/houngans? Their main selling point was the ability to summon and ward spirits and ghosts, but with the current rules anyone with enough dots in occults and research about the entity can potentially do the same.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 12-19-2018, 05:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-19T09:39:57-08:00","id":1275313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raistlin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1274855-second-sight-third-eye?p=1275254#post1275254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about shamans and vodouns/houngans? Their main selling point was the ability to summon and ward spirits and ghosts, but with the current rules anyone with enough dots in occults and research about the entity can potentially do the same.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's some merits for that, and with their tradition they gain some benefits to make it easier for them too. It's not quite an exclusive capability anymore, but definitely something they're well suited to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-19T10:30:38-08:00","id":1275323,"title":"","content":"i LOVE this, very great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-19T22:57:47-08:00","id":1275453,"title":"","content":"Is it only available in pdf format?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23573-thricehonored","name":"ThriceHonored","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-20T12:38:10-08:00","id":1275602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ThriceHonored</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1274855-second-sight-third-eye?p=1275453#post1275453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it only available in pdf format?</div> </div> </div> </div>Vault stuff is PDF only, currently, so yeah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-10T17:47:02-07:00","id":1323557,"title":"","content":"As the person who wrote all the Supernatural Merits in Hurt Locker, I'd just like to say that this is the kind of book I was dreaming of when I wrote it. I tried to address as much as I could with the space and content constraints I was under, but I'm glad someone else was able to pick up the torch and really give Second Sighters the revival they so richly deserved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/759-willr","name":"WillR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar759_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-14T23:49:53-07:00","id":1324654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WillR</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1274855-second-sight-third-eye?p=1323557#post1323557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As the person who wrote all the Supernatural Merits in Hurt Locker, I'd just like to say that this is the kind of book I was dreaming of when I wrote it. I tried to address as much as I could with the space and content constraints I was under, but I'm glad someone else was able to pick up the torch and really give Second Sighters the revival they so richly deserved.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did what I could! And for what it's worth, I loved the merits in Hurt Locker, and how unique so many of them were. They really expanded what 'supernatural merit' could mean, and it helped guide me along how I did the Thaum/Psychic split.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-08T17:36:47-07:00","id":1329998,"title":"","content":"So, to avoid spamming too many threads for a Vault supplement, I'll post here.<br /> <br /> I was considering updating <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/260310/Second-Sight-Third-Eye?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Third Eye</a> to a fuller extent than the typo corrections I've done thus far, a 2.0 version so to speak. I know I've wanted to include some sample cults for the example Things That Should Not Be, and there's a few other minor things I wanna add some detail for.<br /> <br /> Is there anything not too huge people would wanna see added? Better description for something, or an example of whatever?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-11T11:34:29-07:00","id":1330416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>falco1029</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1274855-second-sight-third-eye?p=1329998#post1329998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, to avoid spamming too many threads for a Vault supplement, I'll post here.<br /> <br /> Is there anything not too huge people would wanna see added? Better description for something, or an example of whatever?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not familiar with the original, but what I would love in all of the CoD works is turn-by-turn examples of combat or other interactions (searches, evasions, etc.) especially how different systems interact. And I don't mean simply an example of how one spell works, but how an extended interaction of several characters actually works. <br /> <br /> It took several iterations and lots of help from others for me to write up a simple one angel/one demon combat sequence. I'd love to see examples of other systems carefully explained.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-14T19:41:03-07:00","id":1331018,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I'm no good at making one of those believable, myself. It's something I'll ponder for the future.<br /> <br /> In the meantime, I did the update, which has an example Cult of a Thing That Should Not Be, a new merit (Sapiokinesis), some additional advice and sidebar options, and a nice editing pass of sorts to tighten and fix some of it. Can find it here, if you don't already have it!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/260310/Second-Sight-Third-Eye?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...iate_id=259490</a><br /> Or in the Mortal Magic bundle (which is all the Vault supplements I've done that provide options for mortals):<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/280111/Mortal-Magic-BUNDLE?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...iate_id=259490</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-26T17:53:06-07:00","id":1332755,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KieranMullen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1274855-second-sight-third-eye?p=1330416#post1330416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not familiar with the original, but what I would love in all of the CoD works is turn-by-turn examples of combat or other interactions (searches, evasions, etc.) especially how different systems interact. And I don't mean simply an example of how one spell works, but how an extended interaction of several characters actually works. <br /> <br /> It took several iterations and lots of help from others for me to write up a simple one angel/one demon combat sequence. I'd love to see examples of other systems carefully explained.</div> </div> </div> </div>This would be great!